  'Option C (correct) identifies that associated health checks with failover routing policies are essential for Amazon Route 53 to detect endpoint health and automatically redirect traffic. Option A, Option B, and Option D are valid Route 53 routing policies but do not inherently detect endpoint health or trigger automatic failover without associated health checks.',
