  '{3}',
  'Option D (correct) is Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling, which automatically adjusts the number of Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group based on defined policies, such as CPU utilization or network I/O, to handle varying application loads. Option A, AWS CloudFormation, is an infrastructure as code service. Option B, Amazon CloudWatch, is a monitoring and observability service. Option C, AWS Systems Manager, helps manage EC2 instances and on-premises servers.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain19_4',
