  '{1}',
  'Option B (AWS Step Functions) is a serverless workflow service that lets you combine AWS Lambda functions and other AWS services to build business-critical applications. You design workflows as state machines, which define the sequence of steps, their inputs, outputs, and error handling. Option A (Amazon EventBridge) is a serverless event bus that makes it easier to connect applications together using data from your own applications, integrated SaaS applications, and AWS services. Option C (Amazon SNS) is a messaging service for high-throughput, push-based, many-to-many messaging. Option D (Amazon SQS) is a message queuing service.',
