  '{3}',
  'Option D (correct) is AWS Global Accelerator, which uses the AWS global network to route user traffic to the nearest healthy endpoint, improving performance and availability for global applications. Option A (Amazon CloudFront) is a CDN primarily for web content. Option B (Amazon Route 53) is a DNS service. Option C (AWS VPN) provides secure connections over the public internet.',
