  'What is the primary purpose of Amazon S3?',
  'mcq',
  '["To provide object storage for data","To host relational databases","To run serverless compute functions","To manage virtual servers"]'::json,
  '{0}',
  'Option A (To provide object storage for data) is the primary purpose of Amazon S3 (Simple Storage Service). It is designed for storing and retrieving any amount of data from anywhere on the web. Option B (To host relational databases) is the purpose of Amazon RDS. Option C (To run serverless compute functions) is the purpose of AWS Lambda. Option D (To manage virtual servers) is the purpose of Amazon EC2.',
