VALUES (
  'q_20_m_20_3_56',
  'Which AWS database service is specifically designed for analytical workloads and business intelligence, capable of querying petabytes of structured data?',
  'mcq',
  '["Amazon Redshift","Amazon RDS","Amazon DynamoDB","Amazon Aurora"]'::json,
  '{0}',
  'Option A (Amazon Redshift) is the correct choice. Amazon Redshift is a fully managed, petabyte-scale data warehouse service designed for analytical workloads and business intelligence reporting. It is optimized for complex queries on large datasets. Option B (Amazon RDS) is a relational database for OLTP workloads. Option C (Amazon DynamoDB) is a NoSQL database. Option D (Amazon Aurora) is a relational database for OLTP workloads.',
