  'multiple',
  '["Amazon CloudFront","AWS VPN","AWS Direct Connect","AWS Global Accelerator","Amazon Route 53"]'::json,
  '{1,2}',
  'Option B (AWS VPN) establishes a secure, encrypted connection over the public internet between your on-premises network and your Amazon VPC. Option C (AWS Direct Connect) provides a dedicated, private network connection from your premises to AWS, bypassing the public internet. Option A (Amazon CloudFront) is a CDN. Option D (AWS Global Accelerator) improves global application performance. Option E (Amazon Route 53) is a DNS service. These are not for private on-premises to VPC connectivity.',
