  '{1,3}',
  'Option B (Amazon S3) provides highly durable, scalable object storage for a wide range of use cases, including backups, data lakes, and static website hosting. Option D (Amazon S3 Glacier) is a low-cost storage service for data archiving and long-term backup. Option A (Amazon EBS) provides block storage for EC2 instances. Option C (Amazon EFS) provides a scalable file system for EC2 instances. Option E (Amazon RDS) is a managed relational database service.',
