VALUES (
  'q_20_m_20_1_82',
  'A media company needs to store large video files (terabytes each) for long-term archiving, with infrequent access and retrieval times of several hours being acceptable. Which Amazon S3 storage classes are most cost-effective for this scenario? (Select TWO.)',
