  '{1,3}',
  'Option B (Amazon RDS) is a managed relational database service that supports SQL, allowing for complex queries, joins, and transactions. Option D (Amazon Aurora) is a high-performance, MySQL and PostgreSQL-compatible relational database, also designed for complex queries, joins, and ACID-compliant transactions. Option A (Amazon DynamoDB) is a NoSQL key-value and document database, optimized for single-table access patterns and not ideal for complex joins. Option C (Amazon ElastiCache) is an in-memory caching service. Option E (Amazon S3) is object storage, not a database service for structured data with complex query needs.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain20_4',
  NOW(),
  103,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_20_3',
