  'The first step (Option A) is to sign in to the AWS Management Console using the root user credentials. Next, navigate to the IAM Dashboard and select ''Add MFA'' (Option C) for the root user. Then, choose the desired MFA device type (Option D), such as a virtual MFA device. Finally, activate the MFA device (Option B) by following the on-screen instructions, typically by scanning a QR code or entering a key.',
