  'The first step (Option B) is to enable AWS IAM Identity Center in your AWS account. Next, configure the desired directory source (Option A), such as AWS Managed Microsoft AD or an external identity provider. Then, create or synchronize your users and groups (Option D) into IAM Identity Center. Finally, assign these users and groups (Option C) to the appropriate AWS accounts and applications.',
