  NULL,
  'Lambda''s 15-minute timeout (Option A) makes it best suited for short, event-driven, and stateless functions, where execution completes quickly. Fargate''s serverless model (Option B) is ideal for containerized microservices where the operational overhead of managing underlying servers is undesirable. EC2''s instance types (Option C) provide a wide range of customizable CPU, memory, and GPU configurations, allowing users to select the optimal resources for highly specific and demanding workloads.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain20_4',
