  '{"left":["EC2 Auto Scaling","AWS Lambda","Amazon EMR"],"right":["Elastic capacity adjustment for fluctuating traffic.","Automatic scaling and high availability for event-driven code.","Scalable processing of vast datasets with managed clusters."]}'::json,
