  NULL,
  'Amazon S3 (Option A) is an object storage service that stores data as objects within buckets. Amazon EBS (Option B) provides block-level storage volumes for use with Amazon EC2 instances. Amazon EFS (Option C) provides simple, scalable, elastic file storage for use with AWS Cloud services and on-premises resources.',
