  'Match the hybrid storage service to its function.',
  'matching',
  '{"A":"AWS Storage Gateway","B":"AWS DataSync","C":"AWS Transfer Family"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'AWS Storage Gateway (Option A) is a hybrid cloud storage service that connects an on-premises software appliance with cloud-based storage, providing local caching. AWS DataSync (Option B) simplifies, automates, and accelerates moving data between on-premises storage and AWS storage services like Amazon S3 and Amazon EFS. AWS Transfer Family (Option C) provides a fully managed service for securely transferring files into and out of Amazon S3 using SFTP, FTPS, and FTP.',
