  NULL,
  'Amazon ElastiCache provides a fully managed in-memory caching service (Redis or Memcached) to improve application performance by retrieving data from fast in-memory caches instead of slower disk-based databases. Amazon RDS Proxy pools and shares database connections, preventing connection exhaustion for applications like AWS Lambda that create many short-lived connections.',
