  NULL,
  'Aurora Serverless v2 (left 0) scales database capacity on demand in fine-grained increments, optimizing costs for intermittent or unpredictable workloads. Amazon ElastiCache (left 1) provides in-memory caching, reducing the load on the primary database and improving application performance. RDS Read Replicas (left 2) allow offloading read traffic from the primary database instance, improving performance and scalability for read-heavy applications.',
