  NULL,
  'Amazon RDS Read Replicas (left: 0) reduce load on the primary database by offloading read queries (right: 1), improving performance and potentially reducing the need for a larger primary instance. Amazon ElastiCache (left: 1) improves application performance and reduces database load through in-memory caching (right: 2), which can also lower database costs by reducing the number of queries to the primary database. Amazon Aurora Serverless v2 (left: 2) scales database capacity in fine-grained increments, down to minimal ACUs (right: 0), making it highly cost-effective for intermittent or unpredictable workloads by only paying for consumed capacity.',
