  '{"left":["Amazon VPC Peering","AWS Transit Gateway","AWS PrivateLink"],"right":["Connects VPCs in a hub-and-spoke model, supporting thousands of VPCs","Establishes private connectivity to services hosted by other AWS accounts or third parties","Connects two VPCs directly, suitable for a small number of connections"]}'::json,
