  NULL,
  'VPC Gateway Endpoints for S3/DynamoDB (left: 0) allow private subnet access to S3/DynamoDB without a NAT Gateway, incurring no data processing charges (right: 2), which is highly cost-effective. S3 Transfer Acceleration (left: 1) optimizes data transfer speeds for uploads from distant locations (right: 0) by routing traffic through CloudFront edge locations, but it adds a cost. NAT Gateway (left: 2) enables instances in private subnets to access the internet, incurring data processing charges (right: 1) per hour and per GB processed, which can be a significant cost factor.',
  NOW(),
