  NULL,
  'VPC Peering (left: 0) provides a point-to-point connection between two VPCs (right: 2), suitable for simple, limited connections. AWS Transit Gateway (left: 1) offers a hub-and-spoke network for many VPCs and on-premises networks (right: 1), simplifying complex network topologies. AWS Direct Connect (left: 2) provides a dedicated private network connection from on-premises to AWS (right: 0), offering consistent network performance and reduced egress costs compared to internet-based VPNs.',
