  'matching',
  '{"A":"Data transfer out to the internet","B":"Data transfer between AWS Regions","C":"Data transfer within the same Availability Zone"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'Data transfer out to the internet (left: 0) incurs significant costs, optimize with private links or CDN (right: 1) to reduce egress charges. Data transfer between AWS Regions (left: 1) incurs inter-Region transfer costs, optimize with Transit Gateway or VPC Peering (right: 2) over the AWS backbone. Data transfer within the same Availability Zone (left: 2) is generally free of charge (right: 0) when using private IP addresses, making it the most cost-effective for intra-AZ communication.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain21_4',
