  '{"left":["Data transfer out to the internet","Data transfer between AWS Regions","Data transfer within the same Availability Zone"],"right":["Generally free of charge","Incurs significant costs, optimize with private links or CDN","Incurs inter-Region transfer costs, optimize with Transit Gateway or VPC Peering"]}'::json,
