  NULL,
  'AWS WAF (left[0]) helps protect web applications from common ''Web application exploits'' (right[1]) like SQL injection and cross-site scripting. AWS Shield (left[1]) provides managed ''DDoS attacks'' (right[0]) protection for applications running on AWS. Amazon GuardDuty (left[2]) is a threat detection service that continuously monitors for ''Malicious activity detection'' (right[2]) and unauthorized behavior in your AWS accounts and workloads.',
